WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.467
The day's radar is open.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.000
Blips — covered.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.013
The thing is, they all live on somebody else's cloud.

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:18.427
And every 'try it' button points outside.

00:00:20.031 --> 00:00:24.041
By inference, the outside count keeps rising.

00:00:26.046 --> 00:00:29.054
The big blip… us?

00:00:29.054 --> 00:00:35.070
We downloaded the whole list in an hour. Apparently that's loud.

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:42.088
One thing never shows on any radar — our data. It never leaves our own yard.

